[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4380499477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679#issuecomment-4380499477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107679","id":4380499477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBRkeFQ","user":{"login":"goatchurchprime","id":677254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzI1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/677254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime","html_url":"https://github.com/goatchurchprime","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T15:00:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T15:00:44Z","body":"This is a very safe and effective PR to provide the option (and default) to disable a feature hardly anyone knows about and which is designed badly. Someone who was doing this well would likely want to fade in the change of bus (for the change of effect), and would therefore be implementing this a different way using the `area_entered` signal.\r\n\r\nThe real hit is coming from calling the function [`AudioStreamPlayer3D::_get_overriding_area()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/3d/audio_stream_player_3d.cpp#L308) in the physics process for every `AudioStreamPlayer3D`.  If people had thought about it, this would have probably been how it was done at the start.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4380499477/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4381085698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679#issuecomment-4381085698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107679","id":4381085698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBSIQAg","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T16:21:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T16:21:26Z","body":"I should also mention possible follow-ups:\r\n\r\n1. Use passive detection instead of active (collect areas on enter/exit instead of checking every frame).\r\n2. Deprecate or replace the feature. Though we don't have a consensus on this, the feature doesn't seem to be used much, and might not be worth the maintenance cost in the current state. It is also possible to re-implement it by hand, and probably in a better way too.\r\n\r\n(just to clarify, this isn't an appeal to @pirey0 - just noting for posterity)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4381085698/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383322495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679#issuecomment-4383322495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107679","id":4383322495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBUQxfw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T21:35:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T21:35:53Z","body":"> Deprecate or replace the feature. Though we don't have a consensus on this, the feature doesn't seem to be used much, and might not be worth the maintenance cost in the current state. It is also 